The merge-driver CLI delegates to the git-span-core kernel with no worktree sources; the cli_merge_driver integration tests enforce its exit-0-on-resolve, exit-1-with-conflict-markers contract, so edits to either crate must preserve it. The kernel also collapses duplicate same-identity records as part of the merge, reporting the outcome through same_side_collapsed and carrying an unverified sentinel forward rather than resolving it, so a collapse the merge cannot verify must still leave the exit contract intact.
